      "content": "hey, i need some help looking into something weird. i keep getting these \"account not found\" errors on sites i've used for years. it's not just one, it's my old forum, my secondary email, even a social media tag i thought was secure. i know it looks like glitches, but the timing is too specific. it feels like someone is actually scrubbing my digital footprint bit by bit. can you help me look for patterns or see if there's any way to track what's actually happening behind the scenes?",
